ad\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-FE8Zln0D' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-10-01 03:30:04.394 xcodebuild[79938:35286419]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-10-01 03:30:04.609 xcodebuild[79938:35286417] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-OkF5BwQ1' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-10-01 03:30:05.255 xcodebuild[79941:35286436]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-10-01 03:30:05.454 xcodebuild[79941:35286435] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\n docs/design/dao.jing.dht.md             |  49 ++++++-\n docs/design/yin.repl.dao.space-index.md |  57 ++++++++\n src/cljc/dao/jing/dht.cljc              |  10 +-\n src/cljc/dao/space/query.cljc           |  19 ++-\n src/cljc/yin/repl.cljc                  |  21 ++-\n src/cljc/yin/repl/main.cljc             | 230 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++------\n src/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc            | 159 +++++++++++++++++++---\n src/cljc/yin/repl/store.cljc            | 151 +++++++++++++++++----\n src/cljs/dao/stream/datagram/node.cljs  |   8 +-\n test/dao/jing/dht/mesh.cljc             |  28 ++++\n 10 files changed, 629 insertions(+), 103 deletions(-)\nAGENTS.md\ndocs/agents/roles/architect.md\ndocs/design/dao.jing.dht.md\ndocs/design/datom.world.md\ndocs/design/yin.repl.dao.space-index.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
